**SEM-05 (SET-table dedup)**, reviewer-confirmed: the single 3-branch
`INSERT … UNION … UNION` into `staging.wrk_target` (a SET table) was split into
three independent `INSERT INTO staging.wrk_target (col list) (SELECT … EXCEPT
SELECT * FROM staging.wrk_target)` statements. `UNION` operators were removed
and an explicit 8-column INSERT target list was added so the `EXCEPT SELECT *`
positional match is unambiguous. Six SEM-* risks remain open as `TODO(SME)`
pending source DDL / Teradata ground truth. No mechanical syntax/function/
datatype fixes were required.

