| Rule | Line(s) | Change | Class |
|---|---|---|---|
| SEM-05 | 1, 33, 66 | Split the single `INSERT … UNION … UNION` into 3 independent `INSERT … (SELECT … EXCEPT SELECT * FROM staging.wrk_target)` statements; removed `UNION` operators. Each branch now de-duplicates against existing target contents (Teradata SET semantics) instead of across branches. | FIX (reviewer-confirmed SET table) |
| SEM-02 / FN-LATEST | 4-9, 36-41, 68-73 | `SUBSTR(MAX(effective_dt \|\| val), 11, N)` latest-value trick kept as-is; `TODO(SME)` pending `effective_dt` type / value-width confirmation. | SME |
| SEM-06 / DTX-10 | 16-20, 48-52, 80-84 | Implicit string↔date casts (`effective_dt \|\| val`, `src.flgt_dt > (SELECT param_value …)`) kept as-is; `TODO(SME)` pending `param_value` date format. | SME |
| SEM-03 | join keys | `CHAR(n)` padding drift risk on code-column join keys; `TODO(SME)` pending DDL. | SME |
| SEM-04 | 3, 13, 35, 45, 67, 77 | `flgt_dt` / `gmt_flgt_dt` timezone type / session `TIMEZONE` pin; `TODO(SME)`. | SME |
