        inlk.FLT_LEG_SEQ_NO      AS inlk_FLT_LEG_SEQ_NO,
        outlk.FLT_LEG_SEQ_NO     AS outlk_FLT_LEG_SEQ_NO :: SFX-18 CTE chain: base joins inbound/outbound lookups to resolve leg sequence numbers
