| SEM-04 | Timestamp / timezone | Yes (low risk) | Not corrected — `TO_DATE('<% … %>','DDMONYY')` produces a `DATE`; only concern is whether the orchestrator `Current_date` is session-TZ-dependent | SME (confirm `Current_date` source) |
| SEM-05 | SET-table dedup | No | n/a — UPDATE, not INSERT | n/a |
