| SEM-10 | Join-key grain / direction | Yes (`OLD_*` → target mapping) | Not corrected — `OLD_IN_DEP_FLIGHT_DT` → `IN_DEP_FLIGHT_DT` (after the DEF-07 fix) is the intended key mapping, but unconfirmed without ground truth | SME |

