   table as the UPDATE (`BASE.FLT_FOLDERLINKS`) or a distinct
   `BASE.FLIGHT_FOLDERLINKS` table. The names differ — intentional or
   copy-paste defect?
2. **(SEM-03)** Which of the 8 join keys and 8 anti-join keys are `CHAR(n)`?
   If any are, wrap with `RTRIM` to preserve Teradata blank-padded equality.
3. **(SEM-06/DTX-09)** The `'DDMONYY'` mask in
   `TO_DATE('<% …Current_date %>','DDMONYY')` is locale-dependent. Confirm
   the orchestrator's date format and session locale match the mask.
4. **(SEM-06/SEM-08)** If `OLD_LINK_EXPIRY_DT` is NULL, the `IFF` takes the
   FALSE branch and sets `LINK_EXPIRY_DT = Current_date - 1`. Confirm this
   NULL-fallthrough is intended.
5. **(SEM-10)** Confirm `OLD_IN_DEP_FLIGHT_DT` → `IN_DEP_FLIGHT_DT` (after the
   DEF-07 fix) is the intended key mapping.
6. **(SEM-04)** Confirm the orchestrator-supplied `Current_date` is not
   session-TZ-dependent (or that the dependency is acceptable).

